WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.035
America is a nation divided.

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.670
So what should we do about it?

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.270
Well,

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.338
according to GOP

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:07.307
Congresswoman Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:10.477
the solution is a national divorce.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.845
That is a direct quote.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.446
She tweeted this week

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:14.881
that we need to separate

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:16.516
by red and red states

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.283
and blue states

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.885
and shrink the federal government.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.420
Everyone I talked to says this

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.287
from the sick

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.023
and disgusting woke culture issues

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.224
shoved down our throats

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.058
to the Democrats

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:27.327
traitorous America policies.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:30.597
We are done She tweeted about it once

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.732
and then she tweeted about it again

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:33.933
and again.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.635
And she just kept tweeting about it.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.669
And if all of that wasn't

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.604
enough, Greene felt

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.472
the need to elaborate further

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.974
on all of this.

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.511
A national divorce is not a civil war.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.312
It's actually separating

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.015
by red states and blue states

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:51.284
and making state rights and state

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.319
power a lot stronger than it is

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:54.521
right now.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:55.355
It would be shrinking

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:56.289
the federal government.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:57.157
I think it's something

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:58.725
that we should work towards

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.893
because, you know,

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.127
it's kind of the vision

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.762
that our founding fathers had

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:03.763
for America.

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:05.265
And I think it's a great one

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.533
at work in the beginning.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.735
We just got it completely out of control.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.971
It's crazy that I have to say this,

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:14.908
but the Civil War was fought to prevent

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.843
the red states and blue states

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:18.411
from splitting up right.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:19.879
So exactly what is going on?

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:20.747
And she's from Georgia.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.315
So since Biden won that,

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:23.483
that's now a blue state.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:24.284
So what happens there?

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.952
There's a

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:26.553
whole discussion

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.420
at the beginning of this show.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.055
Was about East Palestine, Ohio,

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.091
and the need for government in our lives.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.759
And those are the discussions

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.726
that members of Congress

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.228
should be having about the

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.096
the role that government

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.297
must play in our lives

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:38.198
in a constructive way.

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:39.899
And she's talking about this divorce.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:40.767
She's tweeting about it.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.402
So we keep talking about it.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:42.902
Of course,

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.437
it is preposterous on every level

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.738
and it's very divisive.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.640
I would say that most couples,

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.508
before they get divorced,

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:49.275
go to counseling.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.143
And I think Democrats

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:50.777
would be happy

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.212
to go through that counseling process

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:53.480
because here are the facts.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.381
71% of the GDP, these are

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:56.783
this is getting to the practical reasons

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:57.851
why this would never work. Right.

00:01:57.851 --> 00:02:01.020
71% of GDP comes from Biden counties.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.257
Red states have higher poverty rates.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.592
They collect more.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:07.427
And federal entitlements.

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.862
They cannot be independent

00:02:08.862 --> 00:02:10.530
because they are dependent

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.765
on a lot of these blue states.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:13.600
And so these are

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.701
some of the practical reasons

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.969
that I think Democrats would love to have

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:16.803
this conversation.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:19.205
At the same time, by 20, 40,

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:23.109
something like 30% of the Senate

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.844
will then represent

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:26.579
70% of the American people.

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.581
So there's also this discussion to have

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:30.583
about equal representation

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:31.551
that Democrats,

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:33.720
I think, have been itching to have,

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.655
even if an actual divorce is just

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:36.589
not at all.

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:39.092
And I think also the broader issue here

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.994
is Marjorie Taylor Greene. Right.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:43.029
And she's not anymore

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.497
just this fringe character.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:45.965
Here's Kevin McCarthy

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:47.700
to The New York Times in January.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.601
If you're going to be in a fight,

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.603
